The EEVDF implementation was developed in PulseOS. Its original contribution
history starts at PulseOS commits 42ac831d0ee955dda98e5bf6ad01085352ad04c0
and 0e21c892a409dd3353643897963cfd199124de27.

PulseOS integrates this algorithm through a BaseScheduler adapter. That common
scheduler interface originated in the ArceOS axsched crate and is intentionally
kept outside this algorithm crate:
https://github.com/arceos-org/axsched
